OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a largely dry day    
OL,6,Fwith variable cloud allowing some      
OL,7,Fbright or sunny spells to break        
OL,8,Fthrough. A few showers will spread     
OL,9,Fsouthwards over the Northern Isles     
OL,10,Fduring the day. Fresh northeasterly    
OL,11,Fwinds.                                 
OL,13,CTonight:FA mostly cloudy evening with  
OL,14,Fshowers and a few clear intervals      
OL,15,Fpossible. Remaining mostly cloudy with 
OL,16,Fshowers overnight. Fresh northerly     
OL,17,Fwinds.                                 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
