OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,CFriday:FA mostly cloudy day with       
OL,6,Fshowers spreading southwards, some of  
OL,7,Fwhich may be heavy and wintry. A few   
OL,8,Fbright or sunny intervals possible     
OL,9,Fbetween showers. Fresh northerly       
OL,10,Fwinds. Colder.                         
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FNorth  
OL,13,Fto northeasterly winds bring largely   
OL,14,Fdry conditions, but a few showers are  
OL,15,Fpossible. Variable cloud with bright   
OL,16,For sunny spells.                       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
